      <description>&lt;h1 id=&#34;time-never-began-peter-dziuban&#34;&gt;Time Never Began Peter Dziuban&lt;/h1&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Source: &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.advaita.org.uk/discourses/teachers/time_dziuban.htm&#34;&gt;TW&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Author: Peter Dziuban&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;http://www.amazon.com/exec/obidos/ASIN/1577331605/fromtheunreat-20&#34;&gt;&lt;figure class=&#34;&#34;&gt;&#xA;&#xA;    &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.advaita.org.uk/images/consciousness-is-all-book.jpg&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;&gt;&#xA;        &lt;img src=&#34;https://www.advaita.org.uk/images/consciousness-is-all-book.jpg&#34; alt=&#34;book cover&#34; title=&#34;&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/a&gt;&#xA;&#xA;    &#xA;&#xA;&lt;/figure&gt;&#xA;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Visit &lt;a href=&#34;http://www.consciousnessisall.com&#34;&gt;Peter &amp;rsquo;s website&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;The following is an extract from Peter&amp;rsquo;s book, &amp;lsquo;&lt;strong&gt;Consciousness Is All: Now Life Is Completely New&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;lsquo;, which can be purchased from &lt;a href=&#34;http://www.amazon.com/exec/obidos/ASIN/1577331605/fromtheunreat-20&#34;&gt;Amazon.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&#xA;or from &lt;a href=&#34;http://www.amazon.co.uk/exec/obidos/ASIN/1577331605/thespiritupat-21&#34;&gt;Amazon.UK&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Present Consciousness. Two words. What do they &lt;em&gt;really&lt;/em&gt; mean?&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;As said repeatedly, the fact that &lt;em&gt;Consciousness&lt;/em&gt; is all there is to all Existence, means there never has been a physical, material world—anywhere, ever. If one were to even speak of what is called “the present day” or “all past events,” at most, all so-called events and times always would be &lt;em&gt;mental&lt;/em&gt; only, or entirely “made out of” dream-thought.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
